      "originalText": "scripts/build_snapshot.py -> seeds DB + offline snapshot\nserver.py                 -> replaced by `wrangler dev`\nindex.html fetchJSON()    -> switches to /api/v1/*\n\nAll NOAA feeds send ETag + Last-Modified and answer\n304 to conditional GETs (checked 2026-10-02).",
